================================================================================

Third-party components bundled in editor.js

Toast UI Editor's dist/esm/index.js (from which editor.js is generated) bundles the
components below. Their license texts follow. DOMPurify is no longer bundled: editor.js
imports the separately installed `dompurify` npm package (Apache-2.0 OR MPL-2.0).

- ToastMark (Toast UI's Markdown parser), MIT, Copyright (c) 2020 NHN Corp., including
  code derived from commonmark.js (BSD-2-Clause, Copyright (c) 2014, John MacFarlane) and
  a String.fromCodePoint polyfill by Mathias Bynens (MIT)
- tui-code-snippet 2.3.3, MIT, Copyright (c) 2019 NHN Corp.
- entities 2.2.0, BSD-2-Clause, Copyright (c) Felix Böhm
- mdurl 1.0.1, MIT, Copyright (c) 2015 Vitaly Puzrin, Alex Kocharin
- tslib 2.3.1 helpers, 0BSD, Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation

